# Shared flags for every JS build of the test runner. As in
# bin/apq-js-common.hxml, the output line cannot live here: haxe rejects
# a second `-js` with "Error: Multiple targets", so a later `-js` on the
# command line cannot retarget an hxml that already names an output.
# `test-js.hxml` writes the shared `bin/test.js`; `tools/worker-build.sh`
# passes a per-worker `-js <workdir>/test.js` instead.
#
# test-common.hxml already supplies -cp src, -cp test, -lib utest and
# -main RunTests.
test-common.hxml
-lib hxnodejs
# Mirrors bin/apq-js-common.hxml so the suite runs the shipped codegen — see there.
-D analyzer-optimize
